{"text": "Ivan Dmitritch was an ordinary middle class man who lived with his family on twelve hundred roubles a year, and he was quite satisfied with his life. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One evening after supper, he was sitting comfortably on the sofa and reading the newspaper in peace. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I forgot to look at the newspaper today, said his wife, Masha, who was clearing the table after the meal. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Will you look and see whether the list of winning lottery numbers is printed there, she asked him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yes, it is here, Ivan answered, but is your ticket still good, or has it already run out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is still good, because I collected the interest on it on Tuesday, Masha replied calmly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What is the number, he asked, and she answered at once, Series 9, 499, number 26. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ivan did not believe in lottery luck, and on any other evening he would not have bothered to look at the list at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But now he had nothing else to do, so he lazily ran his finger down the long column of numbers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At once, as if to laugh at his doubts, the number 9, 499 jumped out at him from the second line from the top.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "v", "a", "n", " ", "D", "m", "i", "t", "r", "i", "t", "c", "h", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "r", "d", "i", "n", "a", "r", "y", " ", "m", "i", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "c", "l", "a", "s", "s", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "w", "e", "l", "v", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "d", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "u", "b", "l", "e", "s", " ", "a", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "q", "u", "i", "t", "e", " ", "s", "a", "t", "i", "s", "f", "i", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", 